        <updated>2026-11-18T00:02:00+00:00</updated>
            <summary type="html">
                <![CDATA[
                        <img src="https://happybirthdayivonne.com/media/posts/4/PXL_20260917_204448981.jpg" alt="" />
                    I hastened past the graveyard To receive a witch's package From the&hellip;
                ]]>
            </summary>
        <content type="html">
            <![CDATA[
                    <p><img src="https://happybirthdayivonne.com/media/posts/4/PXL_20260917_204448981.jpg" class="type:primaryImage" alt="" /></p>
                <p><span style="font-weight: 400;">I hastened past the graveyard<br>To receive a witch's package<br>From the other side of the world<br>As a black cat haughtily watched<br>I gently held a brown paper parcel<br></span><span style="font-weight: 400;">Enscriped in unmistakable cursive<br>Home, upon the bed, I tore the wrapper <br>Slit the bindings and opened the box <br>Prepared for the sweet odour of incense <br>Fearsome sigils, or beetle carapaces <br>Most masterfully arranged <br>Except my gaze fell upon Tokidoki stickers <br>A tiny new panda and a dinosaur too <br>Strawberry Koalas and Caramel Corn<br></span><span style="font-weight: 400;">Ruffles and Cheetos and Fritos, oh my <br>Treats and sweets galore were inside <br>From the Wonderful Witch of the West.</span></p>
<hr>
<div class="post__iframe"><iframe width="100%" height="352" style="border-radius: 12px;" data-testid="embed-iframe" src="https://open.spotify.com/embed/track/6k7HtWuprjQmulpo4OpieI?utm_source=generator&amp;si=0512a2871f3e44dc" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="allowfullscreen" allow="autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; fullscreen; picture-in-picture" loading="lazy"></iframe></div>
