                    <p><img src="https://happybirthdayivonne.com/media/posts/3/IMG_9834-1.jpg" class="type:primaryImage" alt="" /></p>
                <p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Lust follows the line <br></span><span style="font-weight: 400;">Of a thrust, up through your spine <br></span><span style="font-weight: 400;">My sweet angel lies with raven feathers <br></span><span style="font-weight: 400;">From the prestezza touch of impurest pleasure <br></span><span style="font-weight: 400;">As your hips rise to dance in spreadeagled sin <br></span><span style="font-weight: 400;">Your serpent touch speaks the Devil's name.</span></p>
